          "settings": {
            "heading": "Why Shilajit Resin?",
            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<ul><li>Only natural supplements rich in Fulvic Acid and over 85+ trace minerals</li><li>\"Destroyer of Weakness\" in Ayurveda - trusted by healers for over 3,000 years</li><li>6 x higher mineral density that most other natural supplements</li><li>100% Pure, wild harvested from the high-altitude Himalayan rocks tested for purity and potency</li><li>Compounds that boost clarity, focus, and cognition that rejuvenate both body and mind.</li></ul>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_nXt8Qr": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "About 85+ Traced Minerals",
            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<p>Our Himalayan Shilajit is naturally rich in fulvic acid and over 85 + essential trace minerals which are carefully sourced, purified and third party lab tested for purity and potency. </p><p>Great for daily vitality, fulvic acid enhances most nutrient absorption at cellular level, while the trace minerals restore balance and support energy metabolism. With a strong bitter, slightly earthy taste with a smoky undertone it delivers the unique flavor that comes from the rich minerals and organic compounds it contains.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_nmRL8A": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Ingredients",
            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<p>All Everest Shilajit is harvested from Nepal, a country with mountainous regions, altitude as high as 5,500 metres.</p><p>30g Jar -  approximately 60 servings (based on a 500 mg serving)</p><p>Each serving is about a pea-sized portion (0.5g) </p><p>Convenient for 2 months daily use at the recommended dose. </p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_NbxP3C": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How to Use",
            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<p>Take 1 heaped teaspoon each morning. Enjoy straight or supercharge your morning beverage or breakfast. Due to the lower GI (slower release) of, you can also use it throughout the day.</p><p>Note: To get the most out of the bioactives in, take daily on an empty stomach and avoid adding it to boiling water (hot is okay).<br/><br/></p>",
            "page": ""
          }
