            "tab_title": "Weeks 1 - 2",
            "slide_heading": "Begin to experience increased energy and focus.",
            "slide_text": "<div class=\"h-max flex flex-col justify-center\">\n<p>Shilajit is best for stamina. During the initial weeks, you will feel a natural boost in energy and endurance as you begin to experience increased focus and reduced fatigue.\n</p>\n\n<p class=\"text-grey\">\nResults can vary based on factors like lifestyle and consistency. While many experience benefits quickly, individual results may vary. For best outcomes, regular use alongside a healthy routine is recommended.\n</p>\n</div>"
          }
        },
        "slide_VUR3wa": {
          "type": "slide",
          "settings": {
            "tab_title": "Weeks 3 - 10",
            "slide_heading": "Feel a noticeable difference in overall wellness.",
            "slide_text": "<div class=\"h-max flex flex-col justify-center\">\n<p>During this stage, fulvic acid boosts nutrient absorption and cellular energy.\nDibenzo-α-pyrones support stamina and recovery through their antioxidant effects.\nThe 85+ trace minerals help balance the body, improving mood and daily performance.\nYou’ll feel more resilient, energetic, and mentally refreshed.\n</p>\n\n<p class=\"text-grey\">\nResults can vary based on factors like lifestyle and consistency. While many experience benefits quickly, individual results may vary. For best outcomes, regular use alongside a healthy routine is recommended.\n</p>\n</div>"
          }
        },
